<title>USA: Patriot National Bank directors buy stock.</title>
<headline>Patriot National Bank directors buy stock.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot National Bank said Tuesday nine of its directors had bought 9,000 of its shares during the last few months.</p>
<p>The bank, which serves Stamford and other communities in Fairfield County, also said six of its officers had bought 1,900 shares, while employees had bought 1,150.</p>
<p>Its share closed at $6 when it was last traded on August 30.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
